ORO ShoppingBench SFT on AnyCloud

The model is owned and released by ORO AI. This independent artifact packages
its public merged checkpoint for finite, AnyCloud-powered GPU inference.
It is not an official ORO image. Weights download from the pinned creator-owned
Hugging Face release at runtime and are not included in the container.

